---
title: WriteOff State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : Warehouse Keeper creates request (batch qty, reason)
    Draft --> Draft : update items / attach evidence (editable)
    Draft --> Submitted : submit for review (with supporting evidence)
    Draft --> Cancelled : delete/cancel an editable draft
    Submitted --> Approved : Admin approves write-off
    Submitted --> Rejected : Admin rejects
    Rejected --> Draft : revise and resubmit
    Approved --> Processed : stock decreased per document (locked qty removed)
    Processed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
